---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import WhatsApp from '../components/WhatsApp.astro';
import {whatsapp,phone} from '../data/contact';
---
<Layout title="Our Story — Nicoo Furniture Hub, Donholm">
<section class="about-intro"><p class="eyebrow">NICOO FURNITURE HUB / DONHOLM, NAIROBI</p><h1>For the spaces<br/>where <em>life happens.</em></h1><div><p>A first workspace. A fresh start. An idea that’s getting bigger.<br/>We’re here for your next chapter.</p><span>KARIBU NICOO.</span></div></section>
<figure class="about-wide"><img src="/images/nairobi-people.webp" alt="Illustrative scene of Kenyan adults choosing furniture in a contemporary showroom" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high"/><figcaption>People and showroom pictured are AI-generated lifestyle illustrations.</figcaption></figure>
<section class="about-story section"><div><p class="eyebrow">YOUR NEIGHBOURHOOD FURNITURE SHOP</p><h2>Rooted in Donholm.<br/><em>Ready for your next move.</em></h2></div><div><p>Good furniture should feel like it belongs in your life. The chair you settle into every morning. The desk that gives your ideas room. The workspace that helps you get going.</p><p>Nicoo Furniture Hub is an office furniture shop in Donholm, Nairobi. Our collection brings together office chairs, desks, storage and coordinated workspace sets, with prices in Kenyan shillings and a real conversation just a WhatsApp message away.</p><p>Whether you’re making a corner at home work harder or planning an office setup, start with your space, your budget and what matters to you. Tuongee.</p><a class="text-link" href="/visit">Come find us in Donholm <Icon/></a></div></section>
<section class="about-principles"><div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT MATTERS TO US</p><h2>A good fit, in every sense<span class="orange">.</span></h2></div></div><div class="principle-grid"><article><span>01 / YOUR SPACE</span><h3>It starts with you.</h3><p>Not every room needs the same setup. Bring your measurements, your ideas and a little inspiration.</p></article><article><span>02 / YOUR BUDGET</span><h3>Keep it clear.</h3><p>See the price, compare your options, and confirm the details before you decide.</p></article><article><span>03 / YOUR NEXT STEP</span><h3>Let’s talk it through.</h3><p>Ask about sizes, finishes, collection or delivery. A good question is always welcome.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="about-life"><img src="/images/nairobi-workspace.webp" alt="AI-generated inspiration for a Kenyan home workspace" loading="lazy" width="1536" height="1024"/><div><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE SPACE. A LOT OF POSSIBILITY.</p><h2>Your hustle deserves<br/><em>a good home.</em></h2><p>The big plans are yours. Let’s find the furniture that fits.</p><a class="button dark" href="/collection">Explore the collection <Icon/></a></div></section>
<section class="closing-banner"><div><p class="eyebrow">DONHOLM, NAIROBI · {phone}</p><h2>Let’s make room<br/><em>for your next chapter.</em></h2></div><a class="button light" href={whatsapp} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Chat with Nicoo <WhatsApp size={21}/></a></section>
</Layout>
